{"4033190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dr.Award アワード博士と地下遺跡", "steam_appid": 4033190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game can be made in Udemy's &quot;Learn Unreal Engine by Building&quot; course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an instructor, I want as many people as possible to know that even beginners can develop games,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >so I've decided to make the game created in the course available for free as a sample.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a top-down dungeon game in which you progress through underground ruins in search of treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The underground ruins are filled with a variety of traps,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >including spear traps, rolling rocks, chasing skeletons, and collapsing floors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are only five stages in total, but your clear time is saved in a ranking format,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >so try to achieve the fastest clear time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until then, see you in Unreal Engine!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game can be made in Udemy's &quot;Learn Unreal Engine by Building&quot; course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an instructor, I want as many people as possible to know that even beginners can develop games,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >so I've decided to make the game created in the course available for free as a sample.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a top-down dungeon game in which you progress through underground ruins in search of treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The underground ruins are filled with a variety of traps,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >including spear traps, rolling rocks, chasing skeletons, and collapsing floors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are only five stages in total, but your clear time is saved in a ranking format,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >so try to ach